<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Filipyen Yo</para>
  <para style="toc1">FILIPYEN YO</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filipyen Yo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Fil</para>
  <para style="mt1">FILIPYEN YO</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1" />Paul ak Timothée, sèvitè-atache nèt a Jésus Kri yo, a tout fidèl ki nan Kris Jésus ki nan vil Philippe yo, menm avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:28">Trav 20:28</ref></char></note>dirijan legliz ak dyak yo tou: <verse eid="PHP 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:7">Wo 1:7</ref></char></note>Lagras pou nou, ak lapè ki sòti nan Bondye, Papa nou an, e Senyè a Jésus Kri.<verse eid="PHP 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 1:8">Wo 1:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Mwen remèsye Bondye mwen an nan tout fwa ke m sonje nou. <verse eid="PHP 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4" />Mwen toujou ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:9">Wo 1:9</ref></char></note>ofri lapriyè avèk jwa nan kè m nan tout priyè mwen pou nou tout, <verse eid="PHP 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5" />akoz de patisipasyon nou nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 1:7">Fil 1:7</ref></char></note>levanjil la depi premye jou a jiska koulye a. <verse eid="PHP 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6" />Paske mwen gen konfyans menm nan bagay sa a; ke Sila ki te kòmanse fè yon bon zèv nan nou an, va byen konplete li jiska <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:8">I Kor 1:8</ref></char></note>jou a Kris Jésus a. <verse eid="PHP 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7" />Paske li vrèman gen rezon ke m santi sa sou pati pa nou. Paske nou nan kè m akoz nou te patisipan depi lè m te nan prizon an, ni lè m t ap defann e konfime levanjil la nou te pataje gras la avè m. <verse eid="PHP 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8" />Paske Bondye se temwen mwen, de jan mwen anvi wè nou tout avèk tandrès a Kris Jésus a.<verse eid="PHP 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9" />Mwen priye konsa, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 3:12">I Tes 3:12</ref></char></note>lanmou nou kapab ogmante ankò plis toujou nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:9">Kol 1:9</ref></char></note>vrè konesans, avèk tout bon jijman. <verse eid="PHP 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10" />Pou nou kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:18">Wo 2:18</ref></char></note>vin dakò avèk bagay ki ekselan, pou nou kapab rete sensè e san fot jiska <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:8">I Kor 1:8</ref></char></note>jou a Kris la; <verse eid="PHP 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11" />Se pou nou vin ranpli nèt avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 3:18">Jc 3:18</ref></char></note>fwi ladwati ki vini atravè Jésus Kri a, pou laglwa ak lwanj a Bondye.<verse eid="PHP 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12" />Koulye a, mwen vle nou konnen, frè m yo, ke sikonstans mwen yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 21:13">Luc 21:13</ref></char></note>vin pase pou pi gran pwogrè levanjil la. <verse eid="PHP 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13" />Paske anprizonman mwen pou koz a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 1:7">Fil 1:7</ref></char></note>Kris la vin konnen toupatou nan tout gad palè a e pa tout lòt moun yo. <verse eid="PHP 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14" />Epi pifò nan frè nou yo mete plis konfyans nan Senyè a akoz anprizonman m nan, e yo vin gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:31">Trav 4:31</ref></char></note>plis kouraj toujou pou pale pawòl Bondye a san krent. <verse eid="PHP 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15" />Asireman <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:13">II Kor 11:13</ref></char></note>kèk nan yo menm ap preche Kris avèk lanvi ak konfli, men kèk tou ap preche l avèk senserite. <verse eid="PHP 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16" />Dènye nan sa yo, fè l avèk lanmou, paske yo konnen ke m te chwazi pou defans a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 1:5">Fil 1:5</ref>,<ref loc="PHP 1:7">7</ref>,<ref loc="PHP 1:12">12</ref>,<ref loc="PHP 1:27">27</ref></char></note>levanjil la. <verse eid="PHP 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17" />Premye sa yo pwoklame Kris <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:8">Wo 2:8</ref></char></note>avèk anbisyon pèsonèl, olye santiman de bon kè, akoz yo panse ke sa ka fè m chagren nan anprizonman mwen an.<verse eid="PHP 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18" />Alò, kisa? Sèlman nan chak ka, kit se nan pretèks kit se nan verite, Kris la pwoklame. E se nan sa mwen rejwi mwen. Wi, mwen va rejwi mwen. <verse eid="PHP 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19" />Paske mwen konnen ke sa va sèvi pou delivrans mwen atravè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 1:11">II Kor 1:11</ref></char></note>lapriyè nou yo, ak pwovizyon Lespri Jésus Kri a. <verse eid="PHP 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20" />Selon sensè volonte ak esperans mwen, pou m pa vin wont nan anyen, men ke avèk tout kouraj, Kris va menm koulye a, kòm toujou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 6:20">I Kor 6:20</ref></char></note>egzalte nan kò m <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:8">Wo 14:8</ref></char></note>kit se nan lavi kit se nan lanmò. <verse eid="PHP 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21" />Paske pou mwen menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 2:20">Gal 2:20</ref></char></note>viv se Kris e mouri se avantaj. <verse eid="PHP 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22" />Men si mwen viv toujou nan lachè, sa va pote fwi pou travay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:13">Wo 1:13</ref></char></note> mwen. Konsa, mwen pa menm konnen kilès pou m ta pito. <verse eid="PHP 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23" />Men mwen sanse presyon nan toulède direksyon yo. Mwen ta <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:8">II Kor 5:8</ref></char></note>anvi ale, pou m kapab avèk Kris, paske sa pi bon anpil, <verse eid="PHP 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24" />men pou m rete nan lachè a pi nesesè pou koz a nou menm. <verse eid="PHP 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:24">Fil 2:24</ref></char></note>Konvenk de sa, mwen konnen ke mwen va rete pou kontinye avèk nou tout, pou pwogrè ak lajwa nou nan lafwa. <verse eid="PHP 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26" />Konsa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:12">II Kor 5:12</ref></char></note>konfyans fyète nou an nan mwen kapab vin debòde nan Jésus Kri lè mwen vin bò kote nou an ankò.<verse eid="PHP 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27" />Sèlman, kondwi tèt nou nan yon fason ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:1">Ef 4:1</ref></char></note>dign de levanjil a Jésus Kri a, pou si mwen vini wè nou oubyen rete absan, mwen kapab tande ke nou kanpe fèm nan yon sèl espri, avèk yon sèl panse, nan lite ansanm pou lafwa a levanjil la, <verse eid="PHP 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28" />san okenn perèz a lènmi nou yo, ki se yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 1:5">II Tes 1:5</ref></char></note>sign destriksyon pou yo menm, men sali pou nou menm, e sa anplis, soti nan Bondye. <verse eid="PHP 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29" />Paske, a nou menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:11">Mat 5:11</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 5:12">12</ref></char></note>li te vin pèmèt, pou koz a Kris la, non sèlman pou kwè nan Li, men osi pou soufri pou koz Li. <verse eid="PHP 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30" />Konsa nou ap pase menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:29">Kol 1:29</ref></char></note>konfli entèn ke nou te wè m pase a, e koulye a tande k ap fèt nan mwen.<verse eid="PHP 1:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1" />Konsa, si gen ankourajman nan Kris, si gen konsolasyon nan lanmou, si gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 13:14">II Kor 13:14</ref></char></note>amitye nan Lespri a, si gen afeksyon ak konpasyon, <verse eid="PHP 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:29">Jn 3:29</ref></char></note>fè lajwa mwen vin konplè. Rete nan menm panse a, kenbe menm lanmou an, ak menm linite nan lespri a, byen deside sou yon sèl bi. <verse eid="PHP 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3" />Pa fè anyen nan egoyis oubyen ak vye dezi vanite, men avèk refleksyon ki enb <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:10">Wo 12:10</ref></char></note>gade youn lòt kòm pi enpòtan ke nou menm. <verse eid="PHP 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4" />Pa sèlman chèche pwòp enterè pèsonèl pa nou, men osi enterè a lòt yo.<verse eid="PHP 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 11:29">Mat 11:29</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Se pou nou genyen santiman sila nan nou menm ki te osi nan Kris Jésus a <verse eid="PHP 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6" />ki, malgre Li te egziste nan fòm Bondye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:18">Jn 5:18</ref></char></note>pa t gade egalite li avèk Bondye yon choz pou L ta kenbe di, <verse eid="PHP 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7" />men te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 8:9">II Kor 8:9</ref></char></note>vide tèt li, e te pran fòm a yon sèvitè-atache nèt, e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 2:17">Eb 2:17</ref></char></note>vin fèt nan imaj a lòm. <verse eid="PHP 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8" />Kòmsi aparans Li te tankou yon moun, Li te bese tèt Li e te vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:39">Mat 26:39</ref></char></note>obeyisan jiska lanmò, menm lanmò sou yon kwa. <verse eid="PHP 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9" />Akòz tout sa, Bondye te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:18">Mat 28:18</ref></char></note>egzalte Li byen wo, e te bay Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:21">Ef 1:21</ref></char></note>non ki pi wo pase tout non yo, <verse eid="PHP 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10" />pouke nan non a Jésus a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:23">És 45:23</ref></char></note>tout jenou va bese, sila ki nan syèl, sou latè, ak anba tè yo <verse eid="PHP 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11" />epi tout lang konfese ke Jésus Kri se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:13">Jn 13:13</ref></char></note>Senyè a pou laglwa Bondye Papa a.<verse eid="PHP 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12" />Konsa, byeneme mwen yo, menm jan ke nou te toujou obeyi, pa sèlman nan prezans mwen, menm koulye a plis toujou nan absans mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 5:9">Eb 5:9</ref></char></note>fè travay sali nou an avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 7:15">II Kor 7:15</ref></char></note>lakrent ak tranbleman. <verse eid="PHP 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13" />Paske se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:3">Wo 12:3</ref></char></note>Bondye k ap travay nan nou, pou fòme volonte ak zèv nou yo, selon bon plezi Li.<verse eid="PHP 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14" />Fè tout bagay san <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:10">I Kor 10:10</ref></char></note>plenyen ni diskite. <verse eid="PHP 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15" />Konsa nou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:6">Luc 1:6</ref></char></note>san fot e inosan, pitit a Bondye ki san repwòch nan mitan a yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:5">Det 32:5</ref></char></note>jenerasyon kwochi e pèvèti. Pami yo, nou vin parèt kòm limyè nan mond lan, <verse eid="PHP 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16" />k ap kenbe fèm a pawòl lavi a, pou nan jou a Kris la, mwen kapab gen rezon pou bay glwa, akoz ke m pa t <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 2:2">Gal 2:2</ref></char></note>kouri anven, ni <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 49:4">És 49:4</ref></char></note>travay anven. <verse eid="PHP 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17" />Men menm si mwen vin vide nèt tankou yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 4:6">II Tim 4:6</ref></char></note>bwason k ap ofri kòm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 28:6">Nonb 28:6</ref>,<ref loc="NUM 28:7">7</ref></char></note>sakrifis ak sèvis lafwa nou, mwen rejwi e mwen pataje lajwa m avèk nou tout.<verse eid="PHP 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18" />Nou menm tou, mwen egzòte nou, rejwi menm jan an, e pataje lajwa nou avè m.<verse eid="PHP 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19" />Men mwen espere nan Senyè a Jésus pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:23">Fil 2:23</ref></char></note>voye Timothée kote nou byen vit, pou m kapab ankouraje tou lè m aprann de kijan nou ye. <verse eid="PHP 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20" />Paske m pa gen okenn lòt moun ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 16:10">I Kor 16:10</ref></char></note>yon kè parèy a li menm, ki va vrèman konsène pou byen nou. <verse eid="PHP 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21" />Paske yo tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:24">I Kor 10:24</ref></char></note>chache pwòp enterè pa yo, e pa sila a Kris Jésus a. <verse eid="PHP 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22" />Men nou konnen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 5:4">Wo 5:4</ref></char></note>prèv valè li, ke li te sèvi avè m pou avansman levanjil la, kòm yon pitit k ap sèvi papa li. <verse eid="PHP 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:19">Fil 2:19</ref></char></note>Konsa, mwen espere voye li kote nou imedyatman, depi mwen wè kijan tout bagay ale avèk mwen. <verse eid="PHP 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24" />Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 1:25">Fil 1:25</ref></char></note>mwen gen konfyans mwen nan Senyè a ke mwen menm osi va vini toutalè.<verse eid="PHP 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25" />Men m te panse li te nesesè pou voye Épaphrodite, frè m nan, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 16:3">Wo 16:3</ref>,<ref loc="ROM 16:9">9</ref>,<ref loc="ROM 16:21">21</ref></char></note>ouvriye ak sòlda parèy mwen, e osi mesaje pa nou e sèvitè pou sa ke m bezwen. <verse eid="PHP 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26" />Paske li te trè anvi wè nou tout, e te twouble akoz ke nou te tande ke li te malad. <verse eid="PHP 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27" />Paske vrèman, li te malad jis nan pwen pou l mouri, men Bondye te fè l gras, e pa li menm sèlman, men osi mwen menm, pou mwen pa ta vin genyen tristès sou tristès. <verse eid="PHP 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28" />Konsa, mwen te voye l avèk plis enpasyans toujou, pou lè nou wè l ankò, nou kapab rejwi, e mwen kapab enkyete mwens pou nou menm. <verse eid="PHP 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29" />Konsa, resevwa li nan Senyè a avèk tout lajwa, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 16:18">I Kor 16:18</ref></char></note>kenbe an wo estim moun tankou li, <verse eid="PHP 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30" />paske li te prèske mouri pou zèv a Kris la, e te riske vi li pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 16:17">I Kor 16:17</ref></char></note>konplete sa ki te manke nan sèvis nou pou mwen menm.<verse eid="PHP 2:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1" />Finalman, frè m yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:18">Fil 2:18</ref></char></note>rejwi nou nan Senyè a! Pou m ekri menm bagay yo ankò pa yon pwoblèm pou mwen, e se yon pwotèj pou nou menm.<verse eid="PHP 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2" />Veye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:16">Sòm 22:16</ref></char></note>chen yo, veye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:13">II Kor 11:13</ref></char></note>ouvriye mechan yo, veye fo sikonsizyon an. <verse eid="PHP 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3" />Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:29">Wo 2:29</ref></char></note>nou menm se vrè sikonsizyon an, ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:23">Jn 4:23</ref></char></note>adore nan Lespri Bondye a, e bay glwa nan Kris Jésus, e ki pa mete konfyans nan lachè. <verse eid="PHP 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4" />Byenke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:16">II Kor 5:16</ref></char></note>mwen menm ta kapab gen konfyans menm nan lachè. Si gen nenpòt lòt moun ki gen lide pou mete konfyans li nan lachè, mwen menm bokou plis ke sa: <verse eid="PHP 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:59">Luc 1:59</ref></char></note>sikonsi nan uityèm jou a, ne nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:1">Wo 11:1</ref></char></note>nasyon Israël la, nan tribi Benjamin an, yon Ebre a Ebre yo; selon Lalwa a, yon Farizyen; <verse eid="PHP 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6" />kòm zele, yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Trav 8:3</ref></char></note>pèsekitè legliz la; kòm ladwati ki nan Lalwa a, ki twouve san fot.<verse eid="PHP 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7" />Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 14:33">Luc 14:33</ref></char></note>nenpòt bagay ki te benefis pou mwen, mwen konte bagay sa yo kòm pèt pou koz a Kris la. <verse eid="PHP 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8" />Anplis de sa, mwen konte tout bagay kòm pèt an konsiderasyon ak piwo valè ke m konnen Kris Jésus a, Senyè mwen an. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:23">Jr 9:23</ref></char></note>Pou Sila mwen te soufri pèt tout bagay yo, e konte yo kòm fatra, pou m kapab genyen Kris. <verse eid="PHP 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9" />E pou m ta kab twouve nan Li, pa avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 10:5">Wo 10:5</ref></char></note>ladwati pa m, ki sòti nan Lalwa a, men ki soti pa lafwa nan Kris la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:30">Wo 9:30</ref></char></note>ladwati ki sòti nan Bondye sou baz lafwa a. <verse eid="PHP 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10" />Pou mwen kapab konnen Li, ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:5">Wo 6:5</ref></char></note>pouvwa a rezirèksyon Li an, ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:17">Wo 8:17</ref></char></note>lamitye a soufrans li yo, ki fè m konfòme menm a lanmò Li, <verse eid="PHP 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11" />pou m ta kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:23">I Kor 15:23</ref></char></note>rive menm nan rezirèksyon a lanmò a. <verse eid="PHP 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12" />Se pa ke m <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:24">I Kor 9:24</ref></char></note>rive la deja oubyen ke m vin pafè deja, men mwen ap pouse pi rèd pou m kapab rive sou pèfeksyon sa a ki te fè Kris Jésus mete men l sou mwen an.<verse eid="PHP 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13" />Frè m yo, mwen pa gade tèt mwen kòm youn ki rive sou li deja, men yon sèl bagay ke m fè; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 9:62">Luc 9:62</ref></char></note>se bliye sa ki dèyè e lonje pa devan pou sa k ap vini an, <verse eid="PHP 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14" />mwen pouse rive vè objektif la, pou m genyen pri wo apèl Bondye<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:28">Wo 8:28</ref></char></note>nan Kris Jésus a. <verse eid="PHP 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15" />Konsa, otan nan nou ki pafè, annou gen menm panse sa a. Epi si nan nenpòt bagay nou pa reflechi konsa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:45">Jn 6:45</ref></char></note>Bondye va osi revele sa a nou. <verse eid="PHP 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16" />Sepandan, nan menm fòs ke nou deja reyisi, annou kontinye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 6:16">Gal 6:16</ref></char></note>viv pa menm prensip ke nou fin atenn deja a. Annou toujou gen menm panse.<verse eid="PHP 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17" />Frè m yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:16">I Kor 4:16</ref></char></note>vin swiv egzanp mwen an, e swiv sila ki mache selon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 5:3">I Pi 5:3</ref></char></note>modèl ke nou gen nan nou an. <verse eid="PHP 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18" />Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:13">II Kor 11:13</ref></char></note>anpil moun mache, de sila mwen te souvan di nou yo, e koulye a mwen di nou ankò menm avèk dlo nan zye m, ke yo se lènmi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 6:14">Gal 6:14</ref></char></note>lakwa a Kris la, <verse eid="PHP 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19" />ki gen pou fen, destriksyon, ki gen pou dye pa yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 16:18">Wo 16:18</ref></char></note>apeti yo, e ki gen pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:21">Wo 6:21</ref></char></note>glwa yo, wont yo, ki fikse panse yo sou bagay tèrès yo. <verse eid="PHP 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20" />Paske pou nou menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:19">Ef 2:19</ref></char></note>sitwayènte nou se nan syèl la. E soti nan li menm, n ap tann ak enpasyans yon Sovè, Senyè a, Jésus Kri, <verse eid="PHP 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21" />ki va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:43-53">I Kor 15:43-53</ref></char></note>transfòme move kò sila a, pou l vin konfòme ak kò laglwa pa Li a. Li va fè sa pa egzèsis a pouvwa ke Li genyen pou soumèt tout bagay anba otorite pa L.<verse eid="PHP 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1" />Konsa, frè byeneme mwen yo, ke mwen trè anvi wè, nou menm ki lajwa m ak kouwòn mwen yo, se konsa pou nou kanpe fèm nan Senyè a, byeneme mwen yo.<verse eid="PHP 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2" />Mwen ankouraje Évodie e mwen ankouraje Syntyche pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:2">Fil 2:2</ref></char></note>viv an amoni nan Senyè a. <verse eid="PHP 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3" />Vrèman, fidèl kòlèg mwen yo, mwen mande nou osi pou ede fanm sa yo ki te pataje lit mwen an pou koz a levanjil la, ansanm avèk Clément osi ak tout lòt ouvriye parèy a mwen yo ki gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:20">Luc 10:20</ref></char></note>non yo nan liv lavi a.<verse eid="PHP 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4" />Toujou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 3:1">Fil 3:1</ref></char></note>rejwi nou nan Senyè a! E ankò mwen va di l, rejwi nou! <verse eid="PHP 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5" />Kite lespri jantiyès nou an byen koni a tout moun. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 16:22">I Kor 16:22</ref></char></note>Senyè a toupre. <verse eid="PHP 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:25">Mat 6:25</ref></char></note>Pa enkyete nou pou anyen, men nan tout bagay pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:18">Ef 6:18</ref></char></note>lapriyè ak siplikasyon, avèk remèsiman, fè demand nou yo byen koni a Bondye. <verse eid="PHP 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7" />Epi konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 26:3">És 26:3</ref></char></note>lapè Bondye, ki plis pase tout konpreyansyon, va pwoteje kè nou ak panse nou yo nan Kris Jésus a.<verse eid="PHP 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8" />Finalman, frè m yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:18">Wo 14:18</ref></char></note>nenpòt sa ki vrè, nenpòt sa ki onorab, nenpòt sa ki dwat, nenpòt sa ki san tach, nenpòt sa ki emab, nenpòt sa ki gen bon repitasyon, si gen yon bagay ki ekselan e si gen yon bagay ki vo lwanj, se pou nou demere nan bagay sa yo. <verse eid="PHP 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9" />Bagay nou te aprann, nou te resevwa, nou te tande e te wè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 3:17">Fil 3:17</ref></char></note>nan mwen yo, pratike bagay sa yo; epi Bondye lapè a va avèk nou.<verse eid="PHP 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10" />Men mwen te rejwi mwen nan Senyè a anpil, ke koulye a, finalman nou retwouve santiman nou pou mwen. Anverite, nou te konsène pou mwen menm avan, men nou te manke okazyon. <verse eid="PHP 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11" />Se pa ke m pale akoz ke m gen nesesite, paske mwen vin aprann jan pou m <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 9:8">II Kor 9:8</ref></char></note>kontan nan nenpòt sikonstans ke mwen ye a. <verse eid="PHP 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12" />Mwen konnen jan pou m vin imilye, e mwen konnen osi jan pou m viv nan abondans. Nan tout kalite sikonstans, mwen te aprann sekrè a vant plen ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:11">I Kor 4:11</ref></char></note>grangou, abondans ak soufri bezwen. <verse eid="PHP 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13" />Mwen kapab fè tout bagay atravè Sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 12:9">II Kor 12:9</ref></char></note>ban m fòs la. <verse eid="PHP 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14" />Sepandan, nou te fè byen pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 10:33">Eb 10:33</ref></char></note>pataje avè m nan soufrans mwen an. <verse eid="PHP 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15" />Nou menm konnen osi, Filipyen yo, ke nan premye predikasyon levanjil la, lè m fin kite Macédoine, ke pa t gen legliz ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:9">II Kor 11:9</ref></char></note>pataje avèk mwen nan kesyon bay ak resevwa a, men nou menm sèlman. <verse eid="PHP 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16" />Paske menm nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:1">Trav 17:1</ref></char></note>Théssalonique, nou te voye plis ke yon fwa yon don pou satisfè bezwen mwen yo. <verse eid="PHP 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:11">I Kor 9:11</ref></char></note>Se pa ke m chache don an pou kont li, men mwen chache pwofi ki ogmante pou kont pa nou. <verse eid="PHP 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18" />Men konsa mwen te resevwa tout bagay nèt e mwen genyen an abondans. Mwen byen founi depi m te resevwa nan men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:25">Fil 2:25</ref></char></note>Épaphrodite sa ke nou te voye a, yon pafen ki santi bon, yon sakrifis akseptab, ki byen fè Bondye plezi. <verse eid="PHP 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19" />Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 9:8">II Kor 9:8</ref></char></note>Bondye mwen an va founi tout bezwen nou yo selon richès Li nan glwa nan Kris Jésus a. <verse eid="PHP 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20" />Koulye a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 1:4">Gal 1:4</ref></char></note>a Bondye nou an ak Papa a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:36">Wo 11:36</ref></char></note>laglwa pou tout tan e pou tout tan. Amèn.<verse eid="PHP 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21" />Salye chak fidèl nan Kris Jésus a. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 1:2">Gal 1:2</ref></char></note>Frè ki avè m yo salye nou. <verse eid="PHP 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 13:13">II Kwo 13:13</ref></char></note>Tout fidèl yo salye nou, sitou sila ki lakay César yo.<verse eid="PHP 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23" />Ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 16:20">Wo 16:20</ref></char></note>lagras Senyè a Jésus Kri kapab avèk nou tout. Amen<verse eid="PHP 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4" />
</usx>